        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "060cbdd3-c2d0-35a4-9cf7-1b0cadd1f98a",
                "word": "occasionnellement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "089b78ab-7745-34f7-a145-f439cef75aa4",
                        "entry_id": "060cbdd3-c2d0-35a4-9cf7-1b0cadd1f98a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dans certaines circonstances ; de manière occasionnelle ; par occasion. Note d’usage : Très occasionnellement signifie des événements moins fréquents que occasionnellement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "22fdee6a-a4b7-496c-ab77-6fbf7b0b51ee",
                                "sense_id": "089b78ab-7745-34f7-a145-f439cef75aa4",
                                "text": "Autant que je sache, ici à Malte occasionnellement, on peut encore voir cette coutume lors de la fête des Saint Jean, les feux de la Saint Jean."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34e2c1b3-0d9d-4854-950a-2852c27b4555",
                                "sense_id": "089b78ab-7745-34f7-a145-f439cef75aa4",
                                "text": "Le chimpanzé est omnivore, et il est occasionnellement carnivore. Il pratique occasionnellement la chasse et l'on peut voir se manifester à la fois coopération et stratégie d'encerclement et de diversion dans la chasse aux petits potamochères."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c39735c-60fb-4628-a2a0-77ba7d28437f",
                                "sense_id": "089b78ab-7745-34f7-a145-f439cef75aa4",
                                "text": "A l’exception de quelques espèces lichénivores, fongivores ou occasionnellement voire exclusivement prédatrices, les larves sont phytophages (généralement oligophage ou monophage). Parmi les espèces nuisibles rencontrées en serres, la majorité sont polyphages."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "efafdc6a-19f7-4502-b0f1-f1264e8af40c",
                        "source_entry_id": "060cbdd3-c2d0-35a4-9cf7-1b0cadd1f98a",
                        "source_sense_id": "089b78ab-7745-34f7-a145-f439cef75aa4",
                        "target_lang_word": "occasionally",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "occasionally",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                        "entry_id": "3e0a289b-2974-372c-83af-d03c55ae6573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On occasion: at relatively infrequent intervals, from time to time, sometimes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eed73f00-8922-4017-88fc-32b4e915255b",
                                                "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                                "text": "God ſetteth no houres for the morning or evening ſacrifice because they may occaſionally be changed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc991f2b-3843-4a79-a918-92fc3b31b9ad",
                                                "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                                "text": "Some perhaps worship only on alternate Sundays; others still more occasionally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a09775f-ee1d-4146-858f-d9b1aac73887",
                                                "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                                "text": "The journal, more occasionally, has turned to what might be called \"fashionable\" themes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8260d65-b74b-4b5d-86af-1dadde51a4e9",
                                                "sense_id": "d086e2d3-62f1-318d-8c53-f606710c8b13",
                                                "text": "Flames could still be seen from town flaring up occasionally on a hill dotted with emergency vehicles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e817f47f-d546-3bd2-b96d-9911dc42f4c2",
                                        "entry_id": "3e0a289b-2974-372c-83af-d03c55ae6573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On an occasion, accidentally, by chance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7623644-740c-4170-8311-83fb1dc1d47d",
                                                "sense_id": "e817f47f-d546-3bd2-b96d-9911dc42f4c2",
                                                "text": "I had met Lord Ossory in the forenoon, who had come to town occasionally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0293cd6f-06fd-4510-a8ea-937c20b246c6",
                                                "sense_id": "e817f47f-d546-3bd2-b96d-9911dc42f4c2",
                                                "text": "Mr Tourville occasionally told his age; just turned of thirty-one."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4da95638-8879-4d05-b2fc-392fa04eb634",
                                                "sense_id": "e817f47f-d546-3bd2-b96d-9911dc42f4c2",
                                                "text": "[N]othing gave him so much joy in conversation, as an opportunity of giving the company to understand, how well he was with persons of distinguished rank and character: he would often (for example) observe, as it were occasionally, that the duke of G— was one of the best natured men in the world […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3076add-7819-38a4-a430-badf5deafa1c",
                                        "entry_id": "3e0a289b-2974-372c-83af-d03c55ae6573",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On the occasion of something else happening; incidentally, by the way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3c26434-ddb6-4381-96ce-05b09c39ec68",
                                                "sense_id": "d3076add-7819-38a4-a430-badf5deafa1c",
                                                "text": "Were nothing els diſcourſively inſerted (as ſome little elſe occaſionally preſented it ſelfe), what paper more currently fit for the bareſt mechanicall uſes, [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9c1fc6f-41d8-4873-b060-fde5d291bf8d",
                                                "sense_id": "d3076add-7819-38a4-a430-badf5deafa1c",
                                                "text": "I think it is plain, that Origen, whatever Character he may have occaſionally given of this Book, did not judge it any part of the Canon..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e0808f6-ff7b-42d8-975e-685979e6f3a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "060cbdd3-c2d0-35a4-9cf7-1b0cadd1f98a",
                        "source_sense_id": "089b78ab-7745-34f7-a145-f439cef75aa4",
                        "target_lang_word": "incidentally",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incidentally",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8953b75-661a-339e-887d-f304be9c3e0a",
                                        "entry_id": "de101744-4505-3cbf-b51d-a67cd4015425",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an incidental manner; not of central or critical importance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b18655a-4885-4610-8372-d8101270ff84",
                                                "sense_id": "f8953b75-661a-339e-887d-f304be9c3e0a",
                                                "text": "The book discussed the subject, but only incidentally."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85f78577-5969-4326-9f67-0d33d541dffe",
                                                "sense_id": "f8953b75-661a-339e-887d-f304be9c3e0a",
                                                "text": "Nor, will the tragic dramatist who would depict mortal indomitableness in its fullest sweep and direct swing, ever forget a hint, incidentally so important in his art, as the one now alluded to."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d20e5e45-a0c3-4f4b-9cc5-576c62104c92",
                                                "sense_id": "f8953b75-661a-339e-887d-f304be9c3e0a",
                                                "text": "Not everybody welcomes standardisation as a principle, because it reduces variety (and, incidentally, tends to dispose of the quainter and more picturesque anomalies)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3dae669-506e-3e72-a2cf-e4166a91a1a3",
                                        "entry_id": "de101744-4505-3cbf-b51d-a67cd4015425",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "By chance; in an unplanned way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba32c772-4122-369f-929a-1ccd8f20e5eb",
                                        "entry_id": "de101744-4505-3cbf-b51d-a67cd4015425",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Parenthetically, by the way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc46fd99-35b8-4620-9315-1b0232d9680b",
                                                "sense_id": "ba32c772-4122-369f-929a-1ccd8f20e5eb",
                                                "text": "Incidentally, did you hear anything new from your brother yesterday?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0189c092-700b-4cd6-88cd-4218ba84a71e",
                        "source_entry_id": "060cbdd3-c2d0-35a4-9cf7-1b0cadd1f98a",
                        "source_sense_id": "089b78ab-7745-34f7-a145-f439cef75aa4",
                        "target_lang_word": "가끔",
                        "target_lang_code": "ko",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "가끔",
                                "target_lang_code": "ko",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2162c17-0409-34e7-bce8-1ba4b9f77f9f",
                                        "entry_id": "a22b882a-8656-31f3-b1bf-0359a019b7db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "시간적ㆍ공간적 간격이 얼마쯤씩 있게."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6333064-930a-46a2-aa67-31e484171cbc",
                                                "sense_id": "a2162c17-0409-34e7-bce8-1ba4b9f77f9f",
                                                "text": "그를 가끔 만난다."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d494fe31-b0fe-4c5f-8ef0-86a9c6154310",
                                                "sense_id": "a2162c17-0409-34e7-bce8-1ba4b9f77f9f",
                                                "text": "김 선생은 요즘도 가끔 술을 마신다."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d376773-d027-43b2-ba0b-26a1edcd5822",
                                                "sense_id": "a2162c17-0409-34e7-bce8-1ba4b9f77f9f",
                                                "text": "이 길을 따라서 가다 보면 낚시할 만한 곳이 가끔 있어."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abade208-4984-46a7-b4bc-ba0e525cf8df",
                                                "sense_id": "a2162c17-0409-34e7-bce8-1ba4b9f77f9f",
                                                "text": "곳에 따라 가끔 비가 오겠습니다."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db091359-4f4e-494b-89bd-3d4cbaac0e4c",
                                                "sense_id": "a2162c17-0409-34e7-bce8-1ba4b9f77f9f",
                                                "text": "그는 평안도 출신도 아니면서 가끔 거기 사투리를 섞어 쓰기를 좋아했고 그럴 땐 말도 막되어졌다."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
